              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Closest to Linear. A persistent sidebar holds My work, tracked projects and repositories. Everything opens in a split: the list stays on the left with its selection, the item sits on the right, and j / k walks through the list without closing it. A PR that closes my issue is folded under that issue as one row. Projects are the same list component, grouped by the project's main field.",
