                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Only where the user has write access (here sigma-clinic/portal). The “Bug report” form arrives as Markdown sections in the body, required ones marked, its default labels set and editable. GitHub doesn't check a form's required fields for issues created through the API, so githq is the one pointing them out. In a repository you can't push to, forms hand off to github.com instead (H7).",
