                      "content": "A tracked repository is the same List or Board as a project, without project fields. It groups by what GitHub has natively (milestone, assignee, label, issue type, kind), or by a field of a project its items live in. A bar under the header leads to those projects. An untracked repository opened from ⌘K shows only what concerns you, and offers to track it.",
